{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Ascend",
    "steam_appid": 1944260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/3aadfb0cdb65823fcdd76aeafcef4803.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve ancient puzzles, collect tarot cards, and complete the zodiac trials to climb the mountain and save your people in Ascend, a 3D puzzle adventure. Shift between Day, Twilight, and Dusk with your Time Turner to reveal secrets, alter the landscape, and discover hidden paths. Will you ascend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/80348f21139ef60a638704c5a76d077b.avif?t=1754740836\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To save her people and restore balance to the world, Aurora must do what nobody has ever done before: navigate the zodiac trials to scale the mystical mountain and uncover the secrets of a lost civilisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each challenge contains a puzzle linked to the constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/0b349ac4073a9f0e0127582e98706227.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shift between Day, Twilight, and Dusk with the Time Turner. Each time of day has a different effect on the world, revealing secrets, altering the landscape, and opening hidden paths to allow you to solve the puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/c309d990f6df3afb653a247bca1e5c6f.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the mysterious tarot cards across the mountain to learn their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96cb539d991fb15f57cc09c7c17a5d2b.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not the first to attempt this journey. Discover the remnants of past pilgrims, hear their echoes, and uncover the myths that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/2128ab01def4b4f98d6b4b4f91571c77.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just as Aurora must overcome her fears and struggles in the trials, many people face their own struggles with mental health. That\u2019s why we\u2019ve partnered with <strong>Safe in Our World</strong>, a charity focused on supporting mental health awareness through video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/384b2895eb3d2e15c20f6799e4ef310f.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/384b2895eb3d2e15c20f6799e4ef310f.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/384b2895eb3d2e15c20f6799e4ef310f.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/bfcf7e824f24b4889f7df6b37471e4a4.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/3aadfb0cdb65823fcdd76aeafcef4803.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve ancient puzzles, collect tarot cards, and complete the zodiac trials to climb the mountain and save your people in Ascend, a 3D puzzle adventure. Shift between Day, Twilight, and Dusk with your Time Turner to reveal secrets, alter the landscape, and discover hidden paths. Will you ascend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/80348f21139ef60a638704c5a76d077b.avif?t=1754740836\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96c986a758805126444ab4974ec146b3.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To save her people and restore balance to the world, Aurora must do what nobody has ever done before: navigate the zodiac trials to scale the mystical mountain and uncover the secrets of a lost civilisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each challenge contains a puzzle linked to the constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/0b349ac4073a9f0e0127582e98706227.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shift between Day, Twilight, and Dusk with the Time Turner. Each time of day has a different effect on the world, revealing secrets, altering the landscape, and opening hidden paths to allow you to solve the puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/8857ba29325094dfb286c4951e827943.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/c309d990f6df3afb653a247bca1e5c6f.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the mysterious tarot cards across the mountain to learn their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/7f3d3fe943f13fb6e0b6f2a6e5598fa5.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/96cb539d991fb15f57cc09c7c17a5d2b.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not the first to attempt this journey. Discover the remnants of past pilgrims, hear their echoes, and uncover the myths that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.webm?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/6f3d8a8bad42c396b1bd0290b24fb099.mp4?t=1754740836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/2128ab01def4b4f98d6b4b4f91571c77.avif?t=1754740836\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just as Aurora must overcome her fears and struggles in the trials, many people face their own struggles with mental health. That\u2019s why we\u2019ve partnered with <strong>Safe in Our World</strong>, a charity focused on supporting mental health awareness through video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/384b2895eb3d2e15c20f6799e4ef310f.poster.avif?t=1754740836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944260/extras/384b289